  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_branch_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>the arms of a candelabrum or chandelier. Hence a chandelier, especially of the kind used in churches, here made of latten (OED s.v. branch n. 2d)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
